					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-3443504#post-3577951</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-3443504/scp-076-j#post-3577951</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Fri, 25 Aug 2017 00:33:31 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Renasanse</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2753490</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>-Js based on popular Series I articles are kind of getting overplayed.</p> <p>Dissing on Able is also overplayed (mostly in the offsite fandom, given).</p> <p>That said, I actually cracked up reading the first half of this (especially at the implications that 1) he wrote this himself and 2) not turning himself in is punishable by being yelled at). <em>That</em> said, the humor fell off halfway through and I feel like the intentional bad grammar in places is just too much. So you will not be getting a delicious freshly-baked +1 from me this day.</p> <p>Also, I googled &quot;scaphism&quot; and I was underwhelmed, 3/10 you tried.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
